    "title": "Harvest forecast for Iowa and Illinois - dry weather resumes around Quad Cities - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Andy McCray ,\n5 hours ago\nThe drought continues around the Quad Cities – but the dry weather is helping with this year’s harvest. We’ve been very dry lately other than some rain Monday night. There’s just one more chance for rain this week, a low 20% chance Friday morning.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WHBF - OurQuadCities.com.\n1",
